Runtime toolkit
---------------
The executable is built against the `xboxrecomp` toolkit
(https://github.com/sp00nznet/xboxrecomp), which is MIT-licensed. This project
carries the toolkit changes it needs as `xboxrecomp-linux.patch`, which applies
to upstream tag `v0.15.0`. The toolkit's own `LICENSE` and `NOTICE` govern that
code.

